(BAS-06 - undocumented precision on BAS-03: only KEYWORDS are
 case-insensitive. Identifiers are case-SENSITIVE - referring to a
 variable declared `counter` as `COUNTER` is a compile error, and the
 compiler's own "did you mean" suggestion confirms it looked and did not
 find it.
